nterface kind  of like google customers report saving  two to three hours per employee per week  freeing up time to focus on higher value  work  fifth intensi  intense eye is on a mission to make  every workplace safer  using computer vision intensi can  identify unsafe workplace situations and  suggest improvements  for example if a forklift gets too close  to a group of workers at a distribution  center intensive can help inform the  safety team and help create safer  forklift pathways augmenting the health  and safety team ai companies the world  over are rapidly finding ways to augment  humans and make our lives healthier  happier safer and better  [Music]  you
 

